    },
    "body": "Three arms identical except the commitment weight, on the content-copy mixture with the terminal weight held at 30. At 30 the copying the store was built to teach is visible (run, walk. is a verbatim premise span), numerics comply, yes/no partly complies, and the name retention turn returns Ane. At 100 yes/no is correct with correct facts, numerics comply, a copy fragment appears, and the name turn returns Anany. At 60 the model regresses toward prose, the failure mode that predated the demand store. So value-like retention output appears at two of three weights, which makes it a reproducible signal rather than one lucky string, and copying is visible at two weights. It is not a clean dose-response and no weight solves both axes. It does not establish binding: containing the name is not answering, and both Ane. and Anany. would be scored misses by the exact rule. Next: the probe DELTA and read-mass channel on the cw30 and cw100 checkpoints, inference only. References #820",
